<item>
 <title>Frontend performance: illusions &amp; browser rendering</title>
 <link>http://2014.drupalcamp.es/es/node/215</link>
 <description>&lt;div class=&quot;field field--name-body field--type-text-with-summary field--label-hidden&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;field__items&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;field__item even&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Browser rendering&amp;nbsp;- Introduction to how browsers transform your code into composited images as fast&amp;nbsp;they can.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Speed illusions&amp;nbsp;- Getting the user a functional site as early as possible. The user cares more about the first paint than the page load.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Outline:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;ol&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Brief explanation of how browsers make sense of and render our mess.&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;The path to the first paint - why it is important and how to get there faster.&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Rendering performance - how not to shoot yourself in the foot.&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Drupal - the current situation&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://asociaciondrupal.es/es/content/frontend-performance-illusions-browser-rendering&quot;&gt;You can watch the video of this talk here&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;field field--name-field-slides field--type-file field--label-above&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;field__label&quot;&gt;Slides:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;field__items&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;field__item even&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;file&quot;&gt;&lt;img class=&quot;file-icon&quot; alt=&quot;&quot; title=&quot;application/pdf&quot; src=&quot;/modules/file/icons/application-pdf.png&quot; /&gt; &lt;a href=&quot;http://2014.drupalcamp.es/sites/default/files/slides/Manuel_Garcia-DrupalCamp_Spain_2014-slides.pdf&quot; type=&quot;application/pdf; length=861824&quot;&gt;Manuel_Garcia-DrupalCamp_Spain_2014-slides.pdf&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;fieldset class=&quot;field-group-fieldset group-schedule-info collapsible  form-wrapper&quot; id=&quot;node_session_rss_group_schedule_info&quot;&gt;&lt;legend&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;fieldset-legend&quot;&gt;Schedule info&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/legend&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;fieldset-wrapper&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;field field--name-field-accepted field--type-list-integer field--label-inline clearfix&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;field__label&quot;&gt;Status:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;field__items&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;field__item even&quot;&gt;Accepted&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/fieldset&gt;
